docs {
  # CurriculumService.CreateCurriculum

  A new draft for a level, empty or from the suggested plan of its kind

  `/ltedu.academic.v1.CurriculumService/CreateCurriculum` · unary · `ltedu/academic/v1/curriculum.proto`

  ## Request — `CreateCurriculumRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |
  | `level_id` | `string` |  |
  | `name` | `string` | Empty: the template's name, or "Plan de estudios <year>" |
  | `from_template` | `bool` |  |

  ## Response — `CreateCurriculumResponse`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `curriculum` | `Curriculum` |  |

  ## Tipos

  ### `Curriculum`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
