  | `level_id` | `string` |  |
  | `level_name` | `string` |  |
  | `name` | `string` |  |
  | `notes` | `string` |  |
  | `status` | `string` | draft \| active \| archived |
  | `activated_at` | `string` | RFC 3339, empty until it first comes into force |
  | `updated_at` | `string` |  |
  | `subject_count` | `int32` |  |
  | `total_credits` | `int32` |  |
  | `modules` | `repeated Module` | Filled by GetCurriculum only |
  | `subjects` | `repeated Subject` |  |
